      "catId": "p2",
      "title": "AR擴增實境互動繪本 | 巴倫星球有一個願望",
      "titleEn": "AR Interactive Picture Book | Baron Planet's Wish",
      "thumb": "https://scontent.ftpe8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/683901474_1422721266535790_1669889940139068470_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=7OTepzd5WHsQ7kNvwHqO580&_nc_oc=Adqo589ehu91LS_8fOEtmSOGLTDj9TU1K5fNU4ELLw4RwG0SRELs7r_uB0b6DXqKHM4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftpe8-1.fna&_nc_gid=eI9iybZM4UbsmXmJH6DxqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af0JOhg9RuWxABPRWAm5qa0LBYrxuYkRPBUIZL482yPyMg&oe=69F63D41",
      "desc": "繪本搭配 AR,以簡易 APP 為媒介,透過手機掃描繪本,2D、3D 畫面與繪本 以垂直舞台劇形式呈現,結合光影與音效,出現卡牌供讀者選擇,導出不同故 事結局,一共八組 AR 特效,以增添讀者樂趣,豐富視覺效果供觀看者選擇。",
      "descEn": "Pairing the picture book with AR via a user-friendly app, readers can scan the pages with their smartphones to bring 2D and 3D visuals to life in a vertical stage-play format. Combined with dynamic lighting and sound effects, interactive cards appear for readers to choose from, leading to multiple s",
      "images": [
        "https://scontent.ftpe8-4.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/682237429_1422721223202461_4649040845660250560_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=Oo_nKOGr8D0Q7kNvwF_MQbr&_nc_oc=AdoNRNG_ZIEXJjKis_Wpil9TYTt15I541nq0fB1aQokSp53q606nrKfYFHSpU1IuVXM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftpe8-4.fna&_nc_gid=Z9Z76kxucjAb5zdhQ3kYzA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af2wtyoPKd4jCIrc2f7wAWFy42iyKaIh9UA0laeIBv0N2g&oe=69F63A49",
