      "title": "潮塑新生：海廢再生藝術展",
      "titleEn": "Tidal Rebirth: Marine Debris Upcycled Art Exhibition",
      "thumb": "https://scontent.ftpe8-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/490142618_688174537197776_6527286169721245279_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7b2446&_nc_ohc=zIR6yq6KHkEQ7kNvwEqVHoo&_nc_oc=AdrvlpeNqzuRxOEdO323MSN83Z2U9lYSsNcmUlTndXxBdopKNVOg51IrKe16qQecif4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftpe8-3.fna&_nc_gid=EtBq95HOAmLf_LLSe7yt_A&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af3UnOyTFKIU5d5eHW_5fu3RdNxWWN3qfNUUPdp7VJRKWg&oe=69F6632F",
      "desc": "從台北赤峰街打鐵與船零件的歷史記憶出發，將海洋廢棄物轉化為永續藝術。本次展覽結合實體海廢雕塑與互動式沉浸空間，重新定義廢棄物的價值，透過藝術與科技的結合，喚醒大眾對蔚藍星球的守護意識。",
      "descEn": "Rooted in the historical memory of blacksmithing and ship parts in Taipei's Chifeng Street, this project transforms marine debris into sustainable art. By integrating physical marine waste sculptures with interactive immersive spaces, the exhibition redefines the value of discarded materials.",
